    "detailed_description": "The blobs, a nearly extinct alien species, experienced a horrible catastrophe in their home planet that forced them to find a safe place. After discovering dimension travelling, their attempts were unsuccesful. They found themselves with no luck, until a helping hand came around.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586170/extras/7b0b02c2ca19574e855c053ffa45df30.avif?t=1721666503\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br><br><i>These blobs are really needy, and they always require food and affection. In order to satisfy their needs, you must have enough <strong>Blob Points</strong> to purchase certain items.</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blob Points</h2><i>The Blob Points are a currency that is developed with your interactions with the blobs. It can be by feeding them, giving them cool toys and even petting them for a ridiculous amount of time.</i><br><br><i>Explore the vast collection of sweets and toys in the <strong>Shop Menu</strong> to ensure your blobs' happiness and hunger</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586170/extras/f752f4a25921c30f63be7b8817cb8856.avif?t=1721666503\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br><br><i>So, now that your blobs are all set, it's time to make them a cozy and warm home. In <strong>Build Mode</strong>, you will find ALL of the necessary building objects to make the best place for your blobs to live in. This includes, <strong>walls</strong>, <strong>wallpapers</strong>, <strong>doors</strong>, <strong>furniture </strong> and <strong>lighting </strong> items. <br><br>These items come with <strong>multiple vibrant colors</strong> that allow you to customize your builds and make a richer environment for the blobs.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586170/extras/544294387928860269f1414b0f725598.avif?t=1721666503\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br><br><i>Remember, it is always important to check on your blobs! Sometimes they might be <strong>hungry</strong>, <strong>tired </strong> or have a desire for <strong>affection</strong>. In <strong>Inspect Mode</strong>, you are able to view the blobs' needs, and consider adding items that will keep them in a healthy state. </i>",
    "about_the_game": "The blobs, a nearly extinct alien species, experienced a horrible catastrophe in their home planet that forced them to find a safe place. After discovering dimension travelling, their attempts were unsuccesful. They found themselves with no luck, until a helping hand came around.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586170/extras/7b0b02c2ca19574e855c053ffa45df30.avif?t=1721666503\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br><br><i>These blobs are really needy, and they always require food and affection. In order to satisfy their needs, you must have enough <strong>Blob Points</strong> to purchase certain items.</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blob Points</h2><i>The Blob Points are a currency that is developed with your interactions with the blobs. It can be by feeding them, giving them cool toys and even petting them for a ridiculous amount of time.</i><br><br><i>Explore the vast collection of sweets and toys in the <strong>Shop Menu</strong> to ensure your blobs' happiness and hunger</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586170/extras/f752f4a25921c30f63be7b8817cb8856.avif?t=1721666503\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br><br><i>So, now that your blobs are all set, it's time to make them a cozy and warm home. In <strong>Build Mode</strong>, you will find ALL of the necessary building objects to make the best place for your blobs to live in. This includes, <strong>walls</strong>, <strong>wallpapers</strong>, <strong>doors</strong>, <strong>furniture </strong> and <strong>lighting </strong> items. <br><br>These items come with <strong>multiple vibrant colors</strong> that allow you to customize your builds and make a richer environment for the blobs.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586170/extras/544294387928860269f1414b0f725598.avif?t=1721666503\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br><br><i>Remember, it is always important to check on your blobs! Sometimes they might be <strong>hungry</strong>, <strong>tired </strong> or have a desire for <strong>affection</strong>. In <strong>Inspect Mode</strong>, you are able to view the blobs' needs, and consider adding items that will keep them in a healthy state. </i>",
    "short_description": "This Cute Sidescroller RPG is all about taking care of little aliens called blobs! Give them unique names, check their vitals, build colorful houses, play and feed them with a variety of sweets when you have all the time in the world.",
